Author: Sam Achebe <sam@kestrel.example>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 19:30:00 2026 +0000

    Show crews each deadline in Brannock time

    Crews plan shifts on the depot wall clock. The queue now gives
    each job a deadline_local label, for example "Sun 25 Oct, 14:05".

 src/brannock-time.ts | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
